  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MDPA Update 2022 - Ethiopia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MDPA Update 2022 - Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges regering beslutade om en ny landstrategi f&#xf6;r Etiopien i juni 2022. Den nya strategin ska operationaliseras och f&#xf6;r detta &#xe4;ndam&#xe5;l beh&#xf6;ver den multidimensionella fattigdomsanalysen uppdateras. Syftet med operationaliseringen &#xe4;r att konkretisera strategin f&#xf6;r att styra utvecklingen av en relevant portf&#xf6;lj som bidrar till m&#xe5;len i strategin. Operationaliseringen leder till operativa beslut om prioriteringar som ska styra portf&#xf6;ljutvecklingen inom en strategi. Den multidimensionella fattigdomsanalysen kommer att ligga till grund f&#xf6;r operationaliseringen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish government decided on a new country strategy for Ethiopia in June 2022. The new strategy will be operationalized and for this purpose the multidimensional poverty analysis needs to be updated. The purpose of the operationalization is to concretize the strategy to guide the development of a relevant portfolio that contributes to the goals in the strategy. Operationalization leads to operational decisions on priorities that will guide portfolio development within a strategy. The multidimensional poverty analysis will form the basis for the operationalization.</narrative>
  </description>
